  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given an array of integers AAA, write a program to count the number of even and odd elements in the given array.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains an integer NNN, denoting the size of the array.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers, representing the elements of the array.\n\n\nOutput Format\nPrint two space-separated integers, the first representing the number of even elements and the second representing the number of odd elements in the array.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "1≤Ai≤1091 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^91≤Ai​≤109"
    ],
